Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: piccolo
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/multitap-org/piccolo/issues
Source: https://github.com/multitap-org/piccolo
Comment:
 The source tarball (tools/make-source-tarball.sh) holds piccolo and every
 git submodule in deps/ at the commit piccolo pins, plus vendor/librashader:
 the Rust crates librashader needs. Each of them keeps its own license files
 in its folder; this file names the main licenses, not every file. Only the
 parts piccolo builds end up in the package (deps/7zip: only the LZMA / 7z
 decoder of its C/ folder, not the RAR code).

